flowchart TB
APIs[API liveness and dependency readiness] --> Checks[Authenticated bounded operational checks]
Worker[Oracle worker recent database heartbeat] --> Checks
Scan[ClamAV PONG and signature freshness] --> Checks
Providers[Vercel Render Cloudflare deployment identity] --> Checks
Checks --> Evidence[Exact source deployment IDs and private redacted receipts]
Checks --> Failure[Real failure or missing dependency]
Failure --> Contain[Stop affected processing preserve data and evidence]
Contain --> Diagnose[Inspect scoped logs and status without secrets]
Diagnose --> Fix[Reviewed fix and synthetic staging qualification]
Fix --> Restore[Restore prior qualified service or safely redeploy]
Alerts[Alert transport delivery - pending] -. actual delivery must be tested .-> Owner[Responsible operator]
